{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":41,"alongside":62,"kin":67,"engines":92,"usedOn":97,"sites":98,"crewed":99,"museums":100,"hero":106},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/titan-ii-glv.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"specs":35,"tagline":38,"dispatch":39,"description":40},"titan-ii-glv","Titan II GLV","launcher","NASA","USA","Martin Marietta","1964","RETIRED","1957-1969","space-race","Gemini项目的工作马队","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Titan II GLV — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Titan_II_GLV","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Project Gemini launches — NASA","https://www.nasa.gov/gemini/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Gemini-Titan launch history (NASA)","https://history.nasa.gov/SP-4203/toc.htm","deep",[29,30,31,32,33,34],"gemini3","gemini4","gemini6a","gemini7","gemini8","gemini12",{"height_m":36,"diameter_m":37},33,3.05,"Project Gemini的工作马队","发射 Gemini 的 Titan II 与 Mercury 的火箭一样，是改装而来的武器——美国最大的洲际导弹，经过载人评定以运送乘组。它的决定性特点在于燃料：低温推进剂必须在发射前才加注，可能导致发射取消；而 Titan 燃烧的是可贮存液体推进剂，可以随时待命，几乎准时升空。这种准时可靠性比听起来更重要，因为 Gemini 的全部任务就是交会，而在轨道上追上另一艘航天器取决于在精确的时刻发射。作为该计划的主力，它发射了全部十次载人 Gemini 任务，没有损失过任何一个乘组。","Titan II GLV 是美国 Martin Marietta 建造的轨道运载火箭。Project Gemini 的主力火箭。共飞行 12 次，时间为 1964–1966 年。",[42,46,49,52,55,59],{"id":29,"name":43,"first":44,"year":45},"Gemini 3 / GT-3","首次载人Gemini飞行；首次由乘组执行的轨道机动",1965,{"id":30,"name":47,"first":48,"year":45},"Gemini 4 / GT-4","首次美国太空行走（埃德·怀特）",{"id":31,"name":50,"first":51,"year":45},"Gemini 6A / GT-6A","首次载人空间交会",{"id":32,"name":53,"first":54,"year":45},"Gemini 7 / GT-7","14天耐力飞行；Gemini 6A的交会目标",{"id":33,"name":56,"first":57,"year":58},"Gemini 8 / GT-8","首次航天器对接；紧急返回",1966,{"id":34,"name":60,"first":61,"year":58},"Gemini 12 / GT-12","解决了EVA问题——奥尔德林的太空行走；最后一次Gemini飞行",[63],{"id":64,"name":65,"tagline":66},"gemini","Gemini","双人乘组；交会与舱外活动训练",[68,72,76,80,84,88],{"id":69,"name":70,"tagline":71},"atlas-lv-3b","Atlas LV-3B","将水星计划宇航员送入轨道",{"id":73,"name":74,"tagline":75},"saturn-ib","Saturn IB","搭载Apollo 7、Skylab宇航员和ASTP",{"id":77,"name":78,"tagline":79},"saturn-v","Saturn V","将人类送上了月球",{"id":81,"name":82,"tagline":83},"mercury-redstone","Mercury-Redstone","首个美国载人火箭 — 陆军Redstone中程弹道导弹的改进型。发射了Freedom 7（1961-05-05）和Liberty Bell 7（1961-07-21）",{"id":85,"name":86,"tagline":87},"atlas-slv-3d","Atlas SLV-3D Centaur","1970年代NASA外行星探测主力——Pioneer 10/11、Helios 1/2、Mariner 9/10、Pioneer Venus",{"id":89,"name":90,"tagline":91},"space-shuttle-stack","Space Shuttle堆栈","轨道器+ET+SRB;135次飞行任务",[93],{"id":94,"name":95,"tagline":96},"lr87","LR87","双燃烧室自燃推进剂第一级发动机，送出了每一个Gemini乘组",[],[],[],[101],{"id":102,"name":103,"city":104,"item":105},"cape-canaveral-space-force-museum","空军太空暨飞弹博物馆","卡纳维拉尔角，佛罗里达州","发射 Gemini V 的 Titan II 火箭第一级部分（1965年）","/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/titan-ii-glv/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
